{"title": "Ornate Mirror", "pageid": 27256, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ornate_Mirror", "categories": ["Resistant to all Piercing", "Resistant to all Necrotic", "Resistant to all Radiant", "Immune to all Psychic", "Immune to all Poison", "Transcripts", "Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Ornate Mirror</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Ornate_Mirror_Object.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Ornate Mirror Object.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Ornate_Mirror_Object.png/300px-Ornate_Mirror_Object.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Ornate_Mirror_Object.png/300px-Ornate_Mirror_Object.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Ornate_Mirror_Object.png/600px-Ornate_Mirror_Object.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ornate Mirror Object.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"va\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Voice / Actor</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0\"><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm2587402\">Alex Tregear</a></li></ul></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-panel-scroll-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"pi-section-navigation\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pi-section-tab pi-item-spacing pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-label\">Balanced</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"pi-section-contents\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-content pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Balanced Difficulty Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hp\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">HP</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Resistances <sup><a href=\"/wiki/Resistances\" title=\"Resistances\">(info)</a></sup></h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"resistances\" data-item-name=\"resistances\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/42px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/56px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/42px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Conditions</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"conditions\" data-item-name=\"conditions\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Toughness_(Condition)\" title=\"Medium Toughness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium Toughness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Toughness_(Condition)\" title=\"Medium Toughness (Condition)\"><b>Medium Toughness</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><ul><li>This material is unusually strong. Only a hit that deals at least 22 damage can damage it.</li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_FOR_MagicMirror</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_FOR_MagicMirror+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_FOR_MagicMirror+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>7b0d83fb-8cda-4b55-b1b7-fa5073ae5c89</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7b0d83fb-8cda-4b55-b1b7-fa5073ae5c89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7b0d83fb-8cda-4b55-b1b7-fa5073ae5c89\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>FOR_ThayanMirror</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:FOR_ThayanMirror+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:FOR_ThayanMirror+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\nThe <b>Ornate Mirror</b> is a unique magical object in the <a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\">Act One</span></h3>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/Search_the_Cellar\" title=\"Search the Cellar\">Search the Cellar</a>        </div>\n<p>The Ornate Mirror guards the the hidden lab of a Thayian necromancer, <a href=\"/wiki/Ilyn_Toth\" title=\"Ilyn Toth\">Ilyn Toth</a>, who hid among the people of the village many years ago.\n</p><p>Although the magic on the door has faded, it still unleashes devastating magic on anyone it deems an intruder. Every race can introduce themselves with a false name, though doing so does not affect the conversation:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[DRAGONBORN]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - Syrjit Hava.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[DROW]&nbsp;[HALF-DROW]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - Shadow Merodan.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[DWARF]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - Tyndal Hammerfall.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[ELF]&nbsp;[HALF-ELF]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - Ara Silverleaf.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[GITHYANKI]&nbsp;</span></span>My name is - um... Ha'zeera.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[GNOME]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - Zebo Haradook.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[HALFLING]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - Person Someonedale.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[HALF-ORC]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - ...Krunk?</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[HUMAN]&nbsp;[MALE]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - Jack... Humanman.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[HUMAN]&nbsp;[FEMALE]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - Jane... Humanman.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[TIEFLING]&nbsp;</span></span>I'm, eh - Memnon Thrace.</span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlocks</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> can pass a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Arcana Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Arcana\" title=\"Arcana\">Arcana</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> to gain insight that the mirror reflects the habits and personality of its creator. \n</p><p>There are multiple ways to bypass the Ornate Mirror by passing <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\">Intimidation</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> checks. If a party member reads the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Journal\" title=\"Dark Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Journal\" title=\"Dark Journal\">Dark Journal</a>, they can try to trick the mirror into believing they are Ilyn Toth through a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Persuasion Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>. The mirror can also be destroyed; however, its medium toughness requires dealing at least 22 damage to affect it.\n</p><p>Otherwise, the party must answer a series of questions as described in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Search_the_Cellar\" title=\"Search the Cellar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Search the Cellar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Search_the_Cellar\" title=\"Search the Cellar\">Search the Cellar</a> to avoid a dangerous trap and to gain entry into the laboratory. Reading the books located in the shop above and throughout the cellar gives clues to get past the mirror.\n</p><p>Successfully intimidating or answering its questions earns entry into the lab and grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charlatan#Mirror_Master\" title=\"Charlatan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mirror Master\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Charlatan#Mirror_Master\" title=\"Charlatan\">Mirror Master</a> inspiration to party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charlatan\" title=\"Charlatan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Background_Charlatan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Charlatan_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Background_Charlatan_Icon.png/30px-Background_Charlatan_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Background_Charlatan_Icon.png/40px-Background_Charlatan_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charlatan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Background_Charlatan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Charlatan_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/Background_Charlatan_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charlatan\" title=\"Charlatan\">Charlatan</a> background.\n</p><p>If the party fails the mirror's questions, it unleashes a flaming sphere which floats around the room, leaving a trail of fire as it unleashes a burst of flames, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;12 Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;12 <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> to halve the damage. It takes a route throughout the cavern and partly into the tunnel leading in before losing power and returning into the mirror. It is possible to repeat the quiz as many times as needed, with the sphere lacking the power to attack again.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Companion_approval\">Companion approval</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Successfully intimidate the mirror <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/26px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/39px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/52px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/26px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 208.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 206.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"The face in the mirror\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png/310px-Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png/465px-Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png/620px-Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The bright blue head through which the ornate mirror speaks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png/310px-Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"207\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Ornate_Mirror_Entity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The face in the mirror</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 405.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 403.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg/605px-Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg/908px-Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg/1209px-Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg/605px-Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"404\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Jane-katsubo-evil-mirror.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art by Jane Katsubo</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714225935\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.158 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.163 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6778/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 55799/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20522/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 12243/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops coun